## Example : List all major cities of Spain, as JSON Array, then iterate over it to retrieve tourist attractions

[%capture cities %]
    [% osr-ai model:"gpt-4o" cache:false gui:true logLevel:"warn" filters:"code,JSONParse" assign:"cities_ex" %]
        List all major cities of Spain, as JSON Array, max. 2
    [% osr-ai-end %]
[% endcapture %]

[%- for city in cities_ex %]
## [ [[city]] ]([[abs_url]]/[[city]])
[%- capture city_query -%]
    List all top tourist attractions of [[city]], as Markdown bullet list, with links, dont add a chapter
[%- endcapture -%]
[%- osr-ai model:"gpt-4o" cache:false gui:true logLevel:"warn" filters:"code" assign:"city_ret" -%][[-city_query-]][%- osr-ai-end -%][%- endfor -%]

